{"id":"vod_md_5970","vodId":"5970","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"山田君与7个魔女","name_cn":"山田君与7个魔女","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231014-1/ddb70f5fd9b48b909b9f9830ef64b9ed.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在私立朱雀高校之中，山田龙（逢坂良太 配音）是校园中有名的不良少年，同学老师们看见他恨不得绕着道走，而山田龙本人亦对无聊束缚的校园生活深恶痛绝。某日，一场意外竟然让他和优等生白石丽（早见沙织 配音）互换了身体，因而得知了白石丽隐藏在内心里的秘密，并在同级生宫村虎之介（增田俊树 配音）的唆使之下加入了超自然研究部。同为部员的还有对超自然事件超级着迷的伊藤雅（内田真礼 配音）和不良少年椿剑太郎（佐佐木寿治 配音）。几人受腹黑的学生会会长山崎春马（福山润 配音）之命调查校园中存在魔女的事件，就此打开了新世界的大门。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-14 08:52:05","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/miqcgknj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/53O22zs1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/DsqiRChl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/z3tZRuNq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/9Zfi03I7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/okMy2hdc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/G5q8UHrS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/BHVrnPyI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/iPX31ccD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/fMLUt4Cn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/bLubrGXg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231013/87hM1StQ/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:25.058Z"}